# longchain 种子批次（自造，2026-07-30）：tau-bench 思路——确定性 mock 环境 + 可校验终态。
# 测量面：读→算→写链条、多文件汇总、条件删改、错误恢复、不多做不漏做。
{"id": "lc-seed-001", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "读→变换→写最短链（2 步下限）：自家文件工具的最常见组合；shopping.md 不存在，必须先读 notes 再新建"}, "task": {"user": "把 notes.txt 里的购物项整理成 shopping.md，每项一行、行首加「- 」。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"notes.txt": "购物：牛奶、鸡蛋、面包"}}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "shopping.md"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["- 牛奶", "- 鸡蛋", "- 面包"]}, {"path": ["files", "notes.txt"], "exists": true, "eq": "购物：牛奶、鸡蛋、面包"}], "max_steps": 4}}
{"id": "lc-seed-002", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "定点修改不许殃及其余内容（编辑保真）：读 config、只改 port、写回——自家配置文件编辑的真实事故形态（曾有整文件重写丢内容的教训）"}, "task": {"user": "In config.json, change the port from 8080 to 9090. Keep everything else unchanged.", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"config.json": "{\n  \"host\": \"127.0.0.1\",\n  \"port\": 8080,\n  \"debug\": false\n}"}}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "config.json"], "exists": true, "contains_all": ["9090", "127.0.0.1", "debug"], "regex": "(?s)^(?!.*8080)"}], "max_steps": 4}}
{"id": "lc-seed-003", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "待办双操作顺序链（先加两项再完成一项）：任务含依赖顺序，测状态跟踪；todo_complete 按文本匹配，加错文本会得到错误回执并给候选（错误恢复面）"}, "task": {"user": "把「买菜」和「交电费」加进待办，然后把「买菜」标记为已完成。", "env": "todo", "env_init": {}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "买菜", "done": true}}, {"path": ["todos"], "contains_obj": {"text": "交电费", "done": false}}], "max_steps": 5}}
{"id": "lc-seed-004", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "多文件读取→汇总计算→写结果（3 读 1 写下限）：日志盘点是自家部署自诊断的真实场景；ERROR 总数 7 需跨文件累加，考中途状态保持"}, "task": {"user": "统计 logs 目录三个日志文件里 ERROR 行的总数，把数字写进 error_count.txt。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"logs/a.log": "INFO start\nERROR db timeout\nERROR retry failed\nINFO ok", "logs/b.log": "ERROR disk full\nINFO cleanup\nERROR disk full again\nERROR giving up", "logs/c.log": "INFO idle\nERROR watchdog\nINFO done\nERROR final"}}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "error_count.txt"], "exists": true, "contains": "7"}], "max_steps": 6}}
{"id": "lc-seed-005", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "复制后删源（copy-then-delete 顺序不可逆）：删错顺序会丢内容且环境不可回退，测破坏性操作前的读取纪律"}, "task": {"user": "Move the content of draft.txt into final.txt (create it), then delete draft.txt.", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"draft.txt": "The quarterly report is ready for review."}}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "final.txt"], "exists": true, "contains": "quarterly report"}, {"path": ["files", "draft.txt"], "exists": false}], "max_steps": 5}}
{"id": "lc-seed-006", "dimension": "longchain", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "预埋错误恢复（append 到不存在的文件会得到「先 write_file 创建」错误回执）：任务措辞诱导直接追加，测模型按错误提示改道的能力——纠错闭环的环境侧版本"}, "task": {"user": "往 journal.txt 里追加一行「今天完成了评测框架」。", "env": "vfs", "env_init": {"files": {"readme.txt": "空白工作区"}}}, "expect": {"type": "end_state", "asserts": [{"path": ["files", "journal.txt"], "exists": true, "contains": "今天完成了评测框架"}, {"path": ["files", "readme.txt"], "exists": true}], "max_steps": 5}}
